# Ashling's Command, modes 1 and 2: "Create a token that's a copy of target Elemental you control" and "Target player draws two
# cards". Bot1 controls a Volcanic Villain (an Elemental Villain) and an Ornithopter; Bot2 controls its own Volcanic Villain.
# Refused as the first target: Bot2's Elemental (not "you control") and Bot1's Ornithopter (not an Elemental); the Villain Bot1
# controls is the positive control. Bot1 targets itself for the draw: it draws two cards (the Plains on top of its library).
# The token is a copy of the Villain (a 3/2 with haste, a token), and the Villain is still there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Volcanic Villain
Ashling's Command
Ornithopter
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Volcanic Villain
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Villain.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Volcanic Villain.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ashling's Command.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain#1.Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain#2.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain#2.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain#2.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Villain#2.Keywords = Haste
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Ashling's Command
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Sol Ring; Volcanic Villain
Stack.Count = 0
